# graphify generated artifacts (Phase 210 cleanup, 2026-08-26).
# `graphify-out/graph.json` is 41 MB / 1,032,837 lines and `cache/` is 3,147 files — both are
# REGENERATED by `graphify update .`, and tracking them made every `/code-review ultra` fail on
# diff size before it could read a line of source. GRAPH_REPORT.md stays TRACKED: CLAUDE.md tells
# every agent to read it before answering architecture questions, so a fresh clone must have it.
graphify-out/graph.json
graphify-out/cache/

